assertion_line: 102
expression: "help(&scratch, None, &[\"--help\", \"worktree\"])"
---
Worktree commands for all roles:

  acquire        Acquire or reuse a registered worktree directory
  prune          Prune registered worktrees and clean directories

Read-only (status/list/probe):
  status         List registered directories associated with an issue
  list           List every registered directory for the resolved repo identity
  probe          Probe a checkout or registered directory read-only

Use 'phasegent --help worktree <command>' for options. acquire and list run their repository's sync pass first; --no-sync skips it.
